        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-de9af95ca7@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-de9af95ca7@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 08 2020 14:03:58 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Global people analytics company, Great Place to Work (GPTW), named Stryker one of the Best Workplaces in Asia. Companies on this list are recognized for creating sustainable work life balance and where employees experience deeply human relationships on the job. &nbsp;More than 2.2 million employees in eight Asia-region countries where GPTW is represented participated in a Trust Index survey. Employee responses on the survey are the primary deciding factor in creating the list. GPTW recognized Stryker in the multinational category as a result of receiving GPTW honors in Greater China, Japan and Korea. This is Stryker’s first year on the list and it ranks #7.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.greatplacetowork.com/asia-2020\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">VIEW THE LIST</span></a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Apr 08 2020 14:04:49 GMT+0000",
